    {
        "id":  103,
        "destination_id":  "2",
        "category_id":  "6",
        "name":  "Juang 45 Monument",
        "description":  "The Juang 45 Monument is located at Malang City Station, on Jl. Kertanegara, Malang City. This monument symbolizes the resistance of the people of Malang in defending independence during the period from 1945 to 1949. The monument takes the form of a statue depicting the people successfully defeating a giant figure (buta) that symbolizes the colonizers. The main purpose of building the Juang 45 Monument is to ensure that the community always remembers the struggles of the heroes who sacrificed in fighting for independence.",
        "location":  "Jl. Kertanegara, Malang City Station",
        "latitude":  "-7.9778",
        "longitude":  "112.6371",
