        "name":  "Mpu Purwa Museum",
        "description":  "Located at Griya Santa Housing, Jalan Soekarno-Hatta Number 210, Mojolangu, Lowokwaru, Malang City, this museum houses a collection of historical artifacts and ancient objects. The museum is named after Mpu Purwa, a religious figure in ancient Javanese society, especially in East Java. Some historical collections found in this museum include temples, inscriptions, statues, and sculptures that are relics from various kingdoms on the island of Java.",
