        "name":  "Kayutangan Heritage",
        "description":  "Kayutangan Heritage, also known as Kampoeng Heritage Kajoetangan, is an area that is well-designed and filled with Dutch colonial-style buildings. Here, you can find cultural heritage structures that have been built from 1870 to 1920. There are approximately 22 heritage buildings that have been preserved and still function as residences and businesses in this area. To visit, you can head to Jalan Jenderal Basuki Rahmat Gang 4, Kauman, Klojen District, Malang City.",
