        "description":  "Bunker Gedong Ijen Cafe is located in the Jalan Terusan Ijen area, Klojen District, Malang City. Its location is in the Ijen area, known for its strong heritage character. The existence of a bunker beneath the cafe sets it apart from ordinary hangout spots. Visitors can combine their culinary agenda with the experience of seeing one of the underground rooms that is part of the history of the area. Bunker Gedong Ijen Cafe is also directed to have a broader function through the Education Creative Center concept.",
